Project: SmartVision, context-aware PPE compliance and danger-zone monitoring.
Stack: Python 3.10+, ultralytics (YOLOv8), OpenCV, NumPy, Streamlit, PyYAML, SQLite.
Rules:
- Modular code under src/smartvision/ with type hints and docstrings.
- All thresholds, class names, zones and PPE requirements live in config/, never hardcoded.
- Every module must be testable without a camera (accept numpy frames).
- Add a pytest test for each module. Keep functions small and pure where possible.
- Don't add dependencies without telling me. Update requirements.txt when you do.
- Use python3 and the .venv in this folder. Target macOS; auto-select device (mps, then cuda, then cpu).